    "One real shared Recipe/Graph in the same CPU process checks greedy and categorical on nine explicit rows: finite, masked raw NaN/+Inf, masked bias NaN/+Inf/-Inf, all masked, all raw -Inf, and one masked raw -Inf.",
    "The real Model default greedy cold Family has no modifier inputs or validity readback. Default graph code branches remain intact; this is not a fresh full default behavior/performance window.",
    "R2 ordinary execution rejects unique all-masked participant0 (Window slot1) before publishing either head, ledger, output or cursor; actual retirement succeeds and same-key B requeues and emits4.",
    "StateOnly prefill has no modifier input requirement or binding. Bad typed rank rejects before mutation; final prefill emits3, next ready lease emits5.",
    "After pause and actual Session retirement, original committed input partitions rebuild with StateOnly, restore historical pending/cursor, then a new ready mask emits7 without replaying prior selections.",
    "A new request fully reuses the completed consumed-state prefix, uses its own ready inputs and current random cursor, shares physical state/carry, emits6 with exactly one committed draw.",
    "Final published Snapshot versions are0; no active episode/carrier or queued/active key remains."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "Actual fixture is the cached untrained A/H64/FFN128/V64 BF16 Model, N3/R2/C16, pure CPU. No trained-model quality, complete model-family, GPU/backend, capture or throughput conclusion.",
